# Existing-deployment migration uses explicit reviewed operator inputs, not
# original-author defaults or a copied production project/source identifier.
# Generate bootstrap-inputs.candidate.json with deployment_profile.py render
# from an ignored profile, review project_id, region, repository_id,
# deployment_configs and BOTH actual provisioning stages, then explicitly pass
# that private JSON with -var-file. Candidates do not authorize activation.
#
# Preserve existing ignored backend/variables and state lineage; do not overwrite
# them, reset an applied Portfolio service stage, or create another connection.
# This adoption template intentionally has no executable default assignments.
# A fresh-install workflow remains separate from this existing-deployment step.
